SUMMARY:Brimley Brunch (Brimley Society Exclusive)
DESCRIPTION:This event is reserved for Brimley Society Members. Not a Brimley? Upgrade your Membership today and unlock additional premium events! \nWe invite all Brimley Society Members to join us for a morning of warmth\, gratitude\, and celebratory science in recognition of their generous support. A brunch buffet will be provided. \nPlease save this date\, as more details and formal invitations are to follow. \n 
